mp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:20:\"implecode-order-form\";}i:22;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:12:\"coupon-codes\";s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Coupon Codes\";s:4:\"desc\";s:99:\"Apply coupon percentage or fixed value discounts for individual products, brands or entire catalog.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"coupon-codes\";}i:23;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:17:\"printable-coupons\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Printable Coupons\";s:4:\"desc\";s:117:\"Sell printable coupons for your products or for certain value directly from the website. Generate customized coupons!\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:27:\"implecode-printable-coupons\";}i:24;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:20:\"custom-product-order\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Custom Product Order\";s:4:\"desc\";s:124:\"Sort products by priority, lowest price, highest price or randomly. New options in sort drop-down. Assign featured products.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:20:\"custom-product-order\";}i:25;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:10:\"upload-pdf\";s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Upload PDF\";s:4:\"desc\";s:108:\"Easily attach unlimited PDF files to the products, upload to server and provide to clients on product pages.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:20:\"implecode-upload-pdf\";}i:26;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:11:\"product-pdf\";s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Product Print & PDF\";s:4:\"desc\";s:80:\"Print product pages with one click. Export product pages to PDF files with easy.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:11:\"product-pdf\";}i:27;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:21:\"product-manufacturers\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Product Manufacturers\";s:4:\"desc\";s:121:\"Manage product manufacturers & brands in separate screen and easily assign them to products. It has never been so simple!\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"product-manufacturers\";}i:28;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:18:\"product-search-pro\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Product Search PRO\";s:4:\"desc\";s:124:\"Improve WordPress default search engine to provide better product search results. Show product search form with a shortcode.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:3:\"adv\";s:4:\"slug\";s:24:\"implecode-product-search\";}i:29;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:23:\"smart-multiple-catalogs\";s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Smart Multiple Catalogs\";s:4:\"desc\";s:132:\"Create completely separate, multiple catalogs at one website. Assign separate categories, parent URLs, manage them from different...\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"smart-multiple-catalogs\";}i:30;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:20:\"smarter-product-urls\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Smarter Product URLs\";s:4:\"desc\";s:90:\"Set up SEO and USER friendly product page URLs. Add product category in product page URLs.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:3:\"adv\";s:4:\"slug\";s:20:\"smarter-product-urls\";}i:31;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:17:\"inventory-manager\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Inventory Manager\";s:4:\"desc\";s:73:\"Set the product available quantity and automatically manage it when sold.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"inventory-manager\";}i:32;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:17:\"product-locations\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Product Locations\";s:4:\"desc\";s:111:\"Easily manage product locations and get product quotes to multiple email addresses directly from product pages.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:27:\"implecode-product-locations\";}i:33;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:11:\"product-csv\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Product CSV\";s:4:\"desc\";s:82:\"Import, Export & Update products all fields and attributes with a simple CSV file.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"implecode-product-csv\";}i:34;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:17:\"product-discounts\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Product Discounts\";s:4:\"desc\";s:126:\"Apply percentage or value discounts for catalog products. Show the discount offers with a robust widget or shortcode and more!\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:27:\"implecode-product-discounts\";}i:35;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:10:\"table-view\";s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Table View\";s:4:\"desc\";s:66:\"Show products in nicely formatted table with customizable columns.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:10:\"table-view\";}i:36;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:19:\"classic-list-button\";s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"Classic List with Button\";s:4:\"desc\";s:109:\"Premium product listing theme for your catalog. Easily set image size, description name and button position.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"classic-list-button\";}i:37;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:9:\"slim-grid\";s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Slim Grid Theme\";s:4:\"desc\";s:121:\"Premium Grid Theme for product listing. Has additional settings for size, per row elements, description length and price.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"slim-classic-grid\";}i:38;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:13:\"no-image-grid\";s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"No Image Grid Theme\";s:4:\"desc\";s:72:\"Premium Grid Theme for product listing. Best for products without image.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:13:\"no-image-grid\";}i:39;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:9:\"side-grid\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Side Grid\";s:4:\"desc\";s:57:\"Premium product listing grid with image on the left side.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"side-grid\";}i:40;a:5:{s:3:\"url\";s:16:\"classic-grid-pro\";s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Classic Grid PRO\";s:4:\"desc\";s:61:\"Activates more configuration settings for Classic Grid theme.\";s:4:\"comp\";s:6:\"simple\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"classic-grid-pro\";}}', 'no'),
